    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214180/extras/1fef2dca31ea4eae9b73aaa23a2fb36a.avif?t=1751291964\" width=484 height=113 /></span><br>-Select from 7 unique Heroines<br>-154 Skills<br>-Combine Job Class skills to obtain more powerful skills<br>-Customize your quest run -- harder and more enemies but better rewards<br>-Pass Quests to earn more gold<br>-Spend your earned gold to upgrade your favorite Heroine<br>-Mow down hordes of enemies</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214180/extras/fc145dbd9e738285b01d11f0a37a8fdc.poster.avif?t=1751291964\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214180/extras/fc145dbd9e738285b01d11f0a37a8fdc.webm?t=1751291964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214180/extras/fc145dbd9e738285b01d11f0a37a8fdc.mp4?t=1751291964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Choose one of the summoned heroine candidates and dive into an isekai world on the brink of destruction. Collect items, complete posted quests, upgrade your stats and learn new powerful spells in this Action Roguelite with addictive gameplay loop and attractive heroines. Finally, defeat the Demon Lord conqueror and his army of monsters and save the world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214180/extras/fc145dbd9e738285b01d11f0a37a8fdc.poster.avif?t=1751291964\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214180/extras/fc145dbd9e738285b01d11f0a37a8fdc.webm?t=1751291964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214180/extras/fc145dbd9e738285b01d11f0a37a8fdc.mp4?t=1751291964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Choose one of the summoned heroine candidates and dive into an isekai world on the brink of destruction. Collect items, complete posted quests, upgrade your stats and learn new powerful spells in this Action Roguelite with addictive gameplay loop and attractive heroines. Finally, defeat the Demon Lord conqueror and his army of monsters and save the world.</p>",
    "short_description": "Isekai survivors is an Action roguelite with RPG elements and addictive gameplay loop, cute stylized art style and attractive heroines with unique playstyles to choose from. Collect items, complete quests, upgrade your stats and learn new powerful spells to dominate the battlefield.",
